          <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1A1F22] text-base mb-2 group-hover:text-[#A61E22] transition">Emergency Car Lockout</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Fast emergency car lockout service for all vehicle makes and models throughout Delaware.</p>
